==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*peh₂-}}

From {{inh|en|enm|fode}}, {{m|enm|foode}}, from {{inh|en|ang|fōda||food}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*fōdō}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*fōdô||food}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*peh₂-||to guard, graze, feed}}.

Cognate with {{cog|sco|fuid||food}}, {{cog|nds|föde}}, {{m|nds|vöde||food}}, {{cog|fy|fiedsel||food}}, {{cog|nl|voedsel||food}} {{cog|da|føde||food}}, {{cog|sv|föda||food}}, {{cog|is|fæða}}, {{m|is|fæði||food}}, {{cog|got|𐍆𐍉𐌳𐌴𐌹𐌽𐍃||food}}, {{cog|la|pānis||bread, food}}, {{cog|la|pāscō||feed, nourish|pos=verb}}. Related to {{l|en|fodder}}, {{l|en|foster}}.

