===Noun===
[[File:Good Food Display - NCI Visuals Online.jpg|250px|thumb|Various '''foods''']]
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} Any solid [[substance]] that can be consumed by living organisms, especially by [[eat]]ing, in order to sustain life.
#: {{syn|en|Thesaurus:food}}
#: {{ux|en|The innkeeper brought them '''food''' and drink.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1922|author=w:Ben Travers|title=w:A Cuckoo in the Nest| chapter=1| url=http://openlibrary.org/works/OL1521052W| passage=“[…] the awfully hearty sort of Christmas cards that people do send to other people that they don't know at all well. You know. The kind that have mottoes like<br>&nbsp; Here's rattling good luck and roaring good cheer, / With lashings of '''food''' and great hogsheads of beer. […]”}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2013-06-29|volume=407|issue=8842|page=72–3|magazine=w:The Economist| title=[http://www.economist.com/news/international/science-and-technology/21580133-how-microbes-promote-liver-cancer-overweight-punch-gut A punch in the gut]| passage=Mostly, the microbiome is beneficial. It helps with digestion and enables people to extract a lot more calories from their '''food''' than would otherwise be possible. Research over the past few years, however, has implicated it in diseases from atherosclerosis to asthma to autism.}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[foodstuff]].
#: {{syn|en|belly-timber|q1=archaic, now only humorous or regional|foodstuff|provender|Thesaurus:food}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2006|author=C Williams; J Buttriss|title=Improving the Fat Content of '''Foods'''|page=492|isbn=1845691075
|passage=Variation and changes in the trans fatty acid content of different '''foods''', especially in processed '''foods''', further complicate such estimates.}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable|figuratively}} Anything that nourishes or sustains.
#: {{hypo|en|brainfood}}
#: {{ux|en|The man's inspiring speech gave us '''food''' for thought.}}
#: {{ux|en|Mozart and Bach are '''food''' for my soul.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Much Ado About Nothing|act=I|scene=iii|passage=This may prove '''food''' to my displeasure.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1798|author=w:William Wordsworth|title=[[s:Lyrical Ballads (1798)/Lines written a few miles above Tintern Abbey|Tintern Abbey]]
|passage=In this moment there is life and '''food''' / For future years.}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable|MLE}} Any illegal [[substance]] or illegal [[substance]]s, [[drug]]s.
#* {{quote-song|en|date=2009-03-17|artist=w:Tempa T|album=All-Star Pars|track=3|title=Next Hype|url=https://genius.com/Tempa-t-next-hype-lyrics|passage=What kind of things that you have. When I find out don't expect me to stop. I'll come for the P's that you stack. And come for the '''food''' that you blot.}}
#* {{quote-song|en|year=2015|author=w:Stormzy|artist=Stormzy|title={{w|Shut Up (Stormzy song)|Shut Up}}|album=w:Gang Signs & Prayer|track=15|passage=I'm so London, I'm so south / '''Food''' in the ends like there ain't no drought / Flipz don't talk like he's got no mouth}}
#* {{quote-song|en|date=2016-03-04|artist={{w|Kano (British musician)}},{{w|Giggs (rapper)}},{{w|Wiley (musician)}}|album=Made in the Manor|track=4|title=3 '''Wheel-Ups'''|url=https://genius.com/Kano-3-wheel-ups-lyrics|passage=[Verse 2:Kano]:If you've been shotting in the manor from way back when and you ain't on a kilo ting, I don't wanna hear about cunch and '''food''' and tings, man don't do those tings.}}

